# Tiny smoke-test profile for the WASM build.
#
# Goal: a fast, deterministic sim that yields DPS > 0 -- this proves the
# end-to-end path (MEMFS in -> main() -> json2 out), NOT accuracy. A naked
# level-80 caster still casts its default APL off base Intellect, so DPS > 0.
mage="WasmSmoke"
